  "stem": "The function \\(f\\) is defined by \\(f(x) = 5x - 12\\). For what value of \\(x\\) is \\(f(2x) - f(x) = 9\\)?",
  "figure": null,
  "answer_type": "spr",
  "choices": null,
  "answer": null,
  "spr_answers": [
    "9/5"
  ],
  "solution": [
    "\\(f(2x) = 10x - 12\\) and \\(f(x) = 5x - 12\\), so \\(f(2x) - f(x) = 5x\\).",
    "Then \\(5x = 9\\), so \\(x = \\frac{9}{5} = 1.8\\)."
  ],
